        IF delivery's `s 475(1) the company is exempt from audit and the directors have taken advantage of that exemption`
        THEN JUST `s 441 the section does not require it` -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "This does not apply if the company is exempt from audit and the directors have taken advantage of that exemption."
        ELSE JUST `s 441 the directors must deliver it`
