-- src:5949 | (1) The directors of a company subject to the small companies regime—
-- src:5950 | (a) must deliver to the registrar for each financial year a copy of the balance sheet drawn up as at the last day of that year, and
-- src:5951 | (b) may also deliver to the registrar—
-- src:5952 | (i) a copy of the company's profit and loss account for that year, and
-- src:5953 | (ii) a copy of the directors' report for that year.
-- src:5954 | (2) Where the directors deliver to the registrar a copy of the company’s profit and loss account under subsection (1)(b)(i), the directors must also deliver to the registrar a copy of the auditor's report on the accounts (and any directors' report) that it delivers.
-- src:5955 | This does not apply if the company is exempt from audit and the directors have taken advantage of that exemption.
-- src:5956 | (2A) Where the balance sheet or profit and loss account is abridged pursuant to paragraph 1A of Schedule 1 to the Small Companies and Groups (Accounts and Directors’ Report) Regulations ( S.I. 2008/409 ) , the directors must also deliver to the registrar a statement by the company that all the members of the company have consented to the abridgement.
-- src:5957 | (3) ... the copies of accounts and reports delivered to the registrar must be copies of the company’s annual accounts and reports.
@ref s 444(1), (2), (2A) First text: what the directors of a company subject to the small companies regime must or may deliver (src:5949-5957)
GIVEN document IS A `s 441 document`
      delivery IS A `s 441 facts about what is delivered`
GIVETH A MAYBE `s 441 requirement`
`s 444(1) what the first text of section 444 requires of the directors for the document` MEANS
    CONSIDER document
    WHEN `s 441 balance sheet` THEN JUST `s 441 the directors must deliver it`
    WHEN `s 441 profit and loss account` THEN JUST `s 441 the directors may deliver it`
    WHEN `s 441 directors' report` THEN JUST `s 441 the directors may deliver it`
    WHEN `s 441 auditor's report` THEN
        IF NOT delivery's `s 441 the directors deliver a copy of the profit and loss account`
        THEN JUST `s 441 the section does not require it` -- FALSE-kind (a "where" not met, ruling of 2026-11-05): "Where the directors deliver to the registrar a copy of the company's profit and loss account under subsection (1)(b)(i), the directors must also deliver"
        ELSE IF delivery's `s 475(1) the company is exempt from audit and the directors have taken advantage of that exemption`
             THEN JUST `s 441 the section does not require it` -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "This does not apply if the company is exempt from audit and the directors have taken advantage of that exemption."
             ELSE JUST `s 441 the directors must deliver it`
    WHEN `s 441 statement that all the members have consented to the abridgement` THEN
        IF delivery's `s 441 the balance sheet or profit and loss account is abridged under paragraph 1A of Schedule 1 to the Small Companies and Groups (Accounts and Directors' Report) Regulations 2008`
        THEN JUST `s 441 the directors must deliver it`
        ELSE JUST `s 441 the section does not require it` -- FALSE-kind (a "where" not met, ruling of 2026-11-05): "Where the balance sheet or profit and loss account is abridged pursuant to paragraph 1A of Schedule 1"
    OTHERWISE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (silent): the first text of section 444 names the balance sheet, the profit and loss account, the directors' report, the auditor's report and the consent statement

